WEBVTT

00:03.940 --> 00:05.040
Are you all right, Master Vamp?

00:05.040 --> 00:06.670
Your throat doesn't sound so good.

00:06.670 --> 00:08.880
I think I overdid myself at karaoke last night.

00:08.880 --> 00:09.960
I see.

00:09.960 --> 00:11.430
Please be more careful next time.

00:11.430 --> 00:12.900
Which reminds me,

00:12.900 --> 00:15.430
my mother made these for you, Master Vamp.

00:15.430 --> 00:16.390
She said they go well with tea.

00:17.390 --> 00:18.990
How nice of her.

00:18.990 --> 00:20.970
I'll have to return the favor somehow.

00:20.970 --> 00:22.740
Oh no, don't worry about it.

00:22.740 --> 00:26.890
It always makes me feel like I'm still living at home when I have to do these things.

00:27.890 --> 00:29.520
Your mother is so nice.

00:29.520 --> 00:31.650
Shall we get started now?

00:31.650 --> 00:32.670
Oh, sorry.

00:32.670 --> 00:33.480
Please begin.

00:33.480 --> 00:35.020
Thank you all for coming.

00:35.020 --> 00:37.530
We will now begin our weekly meeting.

00:37.530 --> 00:39.000
Today's topic, as usual,

00:39.000 --> 00:41.510
will concern Red's behaviors and how to deal with them.

00:44.700 --> 00:48.190
You should be happy if you can still feel pain.

00:48.190 --> 00:50.330
Don't worry, you'll get what's coming.

00:50.330 --> 00:52.690
I'll rip your kneecaps off punk bitch!!

00:52.690 --> 00:54.080
If I remember correctly,

00:54.080 --> 00:58.870
there <i>was </i> a guy who couldn't
smell anymore after taking my punches.

00:58.870 --> 01:00.460
You may have dodged the first punch,

01:00.460 --> 01:02.330
but I'll fuck you up with the second!!

01:03.620 --> 01:08.290
He always gets us with these kind of threats, doesn't he?

01:08.290 --> 01:10.800
I'll grate that nose right off your face.

01:10.800 --> 01:14.970
I'll keep fucking you up until I can't feel my fists anymore.

01:14.970 --> 01:17.780
How long would it take for that to happen?

01:17.780 --> 01:21.210
I think this is all I can think of for now.

01:21.210 --> 01:23.810
There's a lot more where that came from.

01:23.810 --> 01:26.610
And that's not counting the ones I'd rather <i>not </i> remember.

01:26.610 --> 01:29.020
He was born with it, I tell you.

01:29.020 --> 01:31.060
There are times when I can't sleep because of his threats.

01:31.060 --> 01:32.180
Oh, Number One...

01:32.180 --> 01:35.590
Red is a genius at crushing people's spirit.

01:35.590 --> 01:38.650
His words definitely hurt more than his fists.

01:38.650 --> 01:40.900
Anyone home?

01:40.900 --> 01:42.690
Kayoko told me to bring this to you guys.

01:42.690 --> 01:45.550
She said it was to repay you for the stew you made last time or something.

01:45.550 --> 01:46.460
Mr. Red!

01:46.460 --> 01:48.360
I didn't know you were busy.

01:49.360 --> 01:50.770
What are you planning this time?

01:51.670 --> 01:53.090
"I'll bury you!"

01:53.090 --> 01:54.180
"Punk bitch!"

01:54.180 --> 01:55.740
"Sit up straight!"

01:55.740 --> 01:57.610
You punk bitches,

01:57.610 --> 01:58.600
I'll bury—

02:01.000 --> 02:02.160
W-What the...

02:02.160 --> 02:03.820
Astro Fighter Sunred.

02:03.820 --> 02:06.960
This is a story of the conflict between good and evil

02:06.960 --> 02:10.310
that takes place in the city of Kawasaki.

03:42.740 --> 03:44.060
In the city of Kawasaki

03:44.060 --> 03:47.350
where the magnificent conflict between good and evil usually takes place,

03:47.350 --> 03:51.450
another vicious monster has once again been thrown in the fray.

04:01.160 --> 04:02.540
What is this thing?

04:05.580 --> 04:07.150
He's not a "thing,"

04:07.150 --> 04:10.680
he's Hellwolf, the vicious stuffed animal-type monster!

04:18.160 --> 04:20.300
This little thing is the atrocious Hellwolf?

04:20.300 --> 04:22.340
With a face like <i>that </i>?

04:22.340 --> 04:24.380
And he's supposed to be <i>atrocious </i>?

04:24.800 --> 04:25.360
Oh man.

04:25.360 --> 04:27.080
Don't make fun of him!

04:27.080 --> 04:30.390
He's known as "The Crazy Fangs of Devildom," you know!

04:30.390 --> 04:32.550
"The Crazy Fangs of Devildom"?

04:32.550 --> 04:34.270
Stop it man, I can't breathe!

04:38.430 --> 04:39.790
You two,

04:39.790 --> 04:40.600
I kill youz!

04:45.540 --> 04:47.070
I can't take much more of this.

04:47.070 --> 04:48.490
Tell me he didn't just say

04:48.490 --> 04:49.580
"kill youz."

04:49.580 --> 04:51.160
Come on you two,

04:51.160 --> 04:53.080
it's not nice to laugh at someone like that.

04:53.080 --> 04:55.580
You're hurting both Hellwolf's and Usakotsu's feelings.

04:55.580 --> 04:56.910
But Master Vamp,

04:56.910 --> 04:59.940
he's nothing more than a plush wolf no matter how you see him!

04:59.940 --> 05:03.150
I can't say I agree since I don't know too much about him.

05:03.150 --> 05:05.590
You better laugh while you still can,

05:05.590 --> 05:06.970
Medallion, Khamenman.

05:06.970 --> 05:09.370
Hellwolf actually has a deadly secret.

05:09.370 --> 05:10.480
Roll the tape, P-chan.

05:16.690 --> 05:18.770
This is awesome, P-chan.

05:18.770 --> 05:20.270
We live in such convenient times.

05:20.270 --> 05:23.420
Everyone should be allowed to have one Animal Soldier in their room.

05:23.420 --> 05:25.500
Quit talking, it's about to start!

05:25.500 --> 05:25.980
Okay.

05:26.920 --> 05:28.530
Yoohoo~

05:28.820 --> 05:29.530
Hey, come on.

05:29.530 --> 05:30.530
Hey, come on.

05:30.530 --> 05:30.980
Swan~

05:30.980 --> 05:32.380
Swan~

05:32.380 --> 05:33.980
Hold up, P-chan!

05:33.980 --> 05:37.170
You're supposed to show them the other video,

05:37.170 --> 05:38.730
not your "Birds Gone Wild" collection!

05:40.860 --> 05:41.990
Oh look, a full moon.

05:44.310 --> 05:46.570
Is that Hellwolf?

06:24.830 --> 06:27.970
He can take down robots like they're nothing.

06:27.970 --> 06:29.620
Isn't Hellwolf awesome?

06:29.620 --> 06:30.670
I guess.

06:30.670 --> 06:32.340
He transforms whenever he sees a full moon.

06:32.340 --> 06:33.890
There's going to be a full moon tomorrow night.

06:33.890 --> 06:35.700
I'm sure he'll make short work of Red

06:35.700 --> 06:37.920
once he's in his transformed state!

06:37.920 --> 06:39.930
That's impressive, Hellwolf.

06:39.930 --> 06:41.530
I'm counting on you.

06:41.530 --> 06:43.100
Master Vamp,

06:43.100 --> 06:44.040
I love youz.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.440
You two,

06:45.440 --> 06:46.400
I kill youz.

06:48.730 --> 06:49.830
A fight?

06:49.830 --> 06:50.510
At night?

06:50.510 --> 06:52.480
Why can't it be during the day?

06:52.480 --> 06:54.790
The bugs come out at night and I don't want to get bitten.

06:54.790 --> 06:56.960
What? Buy some OFF Insect Repellent?

06:56.960 --> 06:58.760
Why I oughta...

06:58.900 --> 06:59.970
Fine.

06:59.970 --> 07:01.870
Seven o'clock tomorrow night.

07:01.870 --> 07:04.120
By the way, Mr. Red,

07:04.120 --> 07:07.310
it is finally time for the sun to bow to the moon!

07:14.540 --> 07:15.600
Oh yeah, and then,

07:15.600 --> 07:19.530
I tried slicing some konnyaku and frying it with the rest,

07:19.530 --> 07:21.780
and oh my, wasn't that delicious!

07:21.780 --> 07:23.770
It was such a good idea.

07:23.770 --> 07:25.840
Wasn't it delicious?

07:25.840 --> 07:29.150
Yeah, it was so chewy and everything.

07:29.150 --> 07:31.010
Indeed it was.

07:31.310 --> 07:32.550
Please wait, Mr. Red!

07:32.550 --> 07:33.570
Let go!

07:33.570 --> 07:38.380
I didn't come here to listen to your story about how you cooked leftover rice with konnyaku

07:38.380 --> 07:40.170
because you forgot to prepare rice in the first place!

07:40.170 --> 07:41.710
Just give us a little more time.

07:41.710 --> 07:43.930
I'm sure the moon will be out soon.

07:43.930 --> 07:45.320
Even TV-K's weather broadcast for tonight

07:45.320 --> 07:48.830
predicted we'd have clear skies with partial clouds.

07:48.830 --> 07:49.860
Once the moon is out...

07:49.860 --> 07:52.610
once the moon is out, Hellwolf will fully transform, I promise!

07:52.610 --> 07:54.630
Red, I kill youz!

07:58.650 --> 08:00.160
Screw this.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.890
I won't let you get away, Red!

08:01.890 --> 08:03.060
Hang on tight, Master Vamp!

08:03.060 --> 08:05.050
What are you supposed to be, the Repka?

08:05.050 --> 08:07.480
Heave ho, heave ho!

08:07.480 --> 08:09.850
Master Vamp, the moon!

08:11.740 --> 08:12.880
See, Mr. Red?

08:12.880 --> 08:15.740
Hellwolf is transforming!

08:16.460 --> 08:18.190
See, what did I tell you?

08:21.670 --> 08:22.400
Aw, that was close!

08:22.400 --> 08:23.480
My ass it was!

08:23.480 --> 08:27.480
Why the hell does a monster need a gimmick like looking at the moon in the first place?

08:27.480 --> 08:33.000
And I don't really get the concept of a <i>wolf </i> turning into a wolf after looking at the moon!

08:33.000 --> 08:33.940
Right?

08:33.940 --> 08:34.740
That's my line!

08:41.350 --> 08:43.900
Then we'll just have to take you on.

08:43.900 --> 08:45.080
Here we come, Red!

08:46.460 --> 08:48.700
Let's just say I lost instead.

08:48.700 --> 08:49.510
Are you sure?

08:49.510 --> 08:50.450
Like hell I am!

08:50.450 --> 08:51.550
What are you getting all satisfied about?

08:51.550 --> 08:54.100
Red, I kill youz!

08:55.990 --> 08:59.120
I'm gonna go home before the OFF Insect Repellent's effect wears out.

08:59.120 --> 09:01.570
Did we just win for the first time?

09:01.570 --> 09:03.320
Did the sun just bow to the moon?

09:03.320 --> 09:05.360
I don't really think that's what happened.

09:05.360 --> 09:06.940
Red, I kill youz!

09:06.940 --> 09:08.670
Astro Fighter Sunred.

09:08.670 --> 09:10.880
This is the magnificent story of the conflict between good and evil

09:10.880 --> 09:13.530
that takes place in the city of Kawasaki!

09:20.250 --> 09:22.840
Tonight I'll be attending to

09:22.840 --> 09:24.990
a 31 year old housewife

09:24.990 --> 09:29.110
who has two kids with her husband.

09:30.550 --> 09:32.450
Come on, marry me!

09:32.450 --> 09:34.270
I'll break up with my husband.

09:34.270 --> 09:36.240
Are you trying to put me on a leash?

09:36.240 --> 09:39.200
But both me and the kids love you so much—

09:39.200 --> 09:40.890
Even a dog...

09:40.890 --> 09:43.650
even a dog can remember its way home when necessary.

09:43.650 --> 09:46.620
What happened between you and me was nothing but business.

09:46.620 --> 09:47.940
Don't ever come back here again.

09:52.450 --> 09:54.870
Are you sure about this, Mr. Reiji?

09:54.870 --> 09:57.740
I don't mind playing with them,

09:57.740 --> 10:00.720
but making children cry just isn't my style.

10:00.720 --> 10:03.260
So you broke up with her on purpose?

10:03.260 --> 10:05.590
Besides I'm...

10:05.590 --> 10:08.680
not the type that's well-liked by children.

10:08.680 --> 10:10.530
Reiji, Reiji!

10:11.690 --> 10:13.440
Mr. Reiji.

10:13.440 --> 10:17.960
I'm used to having others hate me, you know.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.760
Mr. Reiji's coming through!

10:19.760 --> 10:22.020
Thanks for another day of hard work!

10:25.390 --> 10:26.900
And the moment you've all been waiting for:

10:26.900 --> 10:29.900
It's time for General Vamp's Quick Cooking!

10:29.900 --> 10:32.880
Today we'll be cooking a "Quick and Simple Vegetable Stir fry Curry"!

10:32.880 --> 10:35.990
I'll show you just how easy it is to save time when making stir fry dishes.

10:35.990 --> 10:37.570
Here are the ingredients:

10:37.570 --> 10:38.720
You first need some curry powder;

10:38.720 --> 10:40.240
feel free to use whatever brand you're used to buying.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.970
Then you need some beef, onions, bean sprouts,

10:42.970 --> 10:45.200
nappa cabbage, and some bell peppers.

10:45.200 --> 10:48.910
First slice the ingredients into bite-size as shown on screen.

10:48.910 --> 10:51.540
Slice the beef into whatever size you think is best.

10:51.540 --> 10:54.030
Next, throw some oil onto the frying pan,

10:54.030 --> 10:55.770
and fry the meat and vegetables.

10:55.770 --> 10:58.420
I suggest you fry the meat first,

10:58.420 --> 11:00.270
almost as if you're making a stir fry.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.280
When everything's all nice and cooked,

11:02.280 --> 11:05.380
put in enough water to cover all the vegetables in the pan,

11:05.380 --> 11:07.900
then add the curry powder and bring your ingredients to a boil.

11:07.900 --> 11:10.190
Mix the curry nice and slowly so it doesn't burn.

11:10.190 --> 11:11.980
Once all of the curry is melted into the mix...

11:13.140 --> 11:15.340
dump it over some rice, and you're done!

11:15.340 --> 11:18.980
Voila, a vegetable stir fry curry for two.

11:18.980 --> 11:20.330
This curry's pretty high quality!

11:20.330 --> 11:22.200
Lemme get a bite of that!

11:22.200 --> 11:24.410
It's like a curry flavored rice bowl, isn't it?

11:24.410 --> 11:26.860
You can also use regular cabbage if you don't have any nappa.

11:26.860 --> 11:29.900
It's very simple to make, so don't hesitate to try it sometime!
